；不補姓名、成員或肯定王號所指。"}],"chapter_id":"c-shiji-061-boyi","book_id":"b-shiji-061","work_id":"w-shiji","source_id":"s-shiji-061-boyi"},{"id":"c-shiji-061-boyi:p007","text":"或曰：「天道無親，常與善人。」若伯夷、叔齊，可謂善人者非邪？積仁絜行如此而餓死！且七十子之徒，仲尼獨薦顏淵為好學。然回也屢空，糟糠不厭，而卒蚤夭。天之報施善人，其何如哉？盜蹠日殺不辜，肝人之肉，暴戾恣睢，聚黨數千人橫行天下，竟以壽終。是遵何德哉？此其尤大彰明較著者也。若至近世，操行不軌，專犯忌諱，而終身逸樂，富厚累世不絕。或擇地而蹈之，時然後出言，行不由徑，非公正不發憤，而遇禍災者，不可勝數也。余甚惑焉，儻所謂天道，是邪非邪？","annotation_status":"named_mentions_first_pass","text_layer":"received_chapter","mentions":[{"id":"c-shiji-061-boyi:m007-0011","start":11,"end":13,"surface":"善人","kind":"unresolved","person_id":null,"status":"unresolved","note":"群體、泛稱、引歌中的虞夏或未定指代；不補姓名、成員或肯定王號所指。"},{"id":"c-shiji-061-boyi:m007-0016","start":16,"end":18,"surface":"伯夷","kind":"person","person_id":"98v_uic_i4i_A","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-shiji-061-boyi:m007-0019","start":19,"end":21,"surface":"叔齊","kind":"person","person_id":"98v_uic_i4i_B","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-shiji-061-boyi:m007-0024","start":24,"end":26,"surface":"善人","kind":"unresolved","person_id":null,"status":"unresolved","note":"群體、泛稱、引歌中的虞夏或未定指代；不補姓名、成員或肯定王號所指。"},{"id":"c-shiji-061-boyi:m007-0041","start":41,"end":46,"surface":"七十子之徒","kind":"unresolved","person_id":null,"status":"unresolved","note":"群體、泛稱、引歌中的虞夏或未定指代；不補姓名、成員或肯定王號所指。"},{"id":"c-shiji-061-boyi:m007-0047","start":47,"end":49,"surface":"仲尼","kind":"person","person_id":"9wm_v9j_esn","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-shiji-061-boyi:m007-0051","start":51,"end":53,"surface":"顏淵","kind":"person","person_id":"k64_xyf_svi","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-shiji-061-boyi:m007-0058","start":58,"end":59,"surface":"回","kind":"person","person_id":"k64_xyf_svi","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-shiji-061-boyi:m007-0077","start":77,"end":79,"surface":"善人","kind":"unresolved","person_id":null,"status":"unresolved","note":"群體、泛稱、引歌中的虞夏或未定指代；不補姓名、成員或肯定王號所指。"},{"id":"c-shiji-061-boyi:m007-0085","start":85,"end":87,"surface":"盜蹠","kind":"person","person_id":"3po_rdb_3hc","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-shiji-061-boyi:m007-0102","start":102,"end":107,"surface":"聚黨數千人","kind":"unresolved","person_id":null,"status":"unresolved","note":"群體、泛稱、引歌中的虞夏或未定指代；不補姓名、成員或肯定王號所指。"}],"chapter_id":"c-shiji-061-boyi","book_id":"b-shiji-061","work_id":"w-shiji","source_id":"s-shiji-061-boyi"},{"id":"c-shiji-061-boyi:p009","text":"「君子疾沒世而名不稱焉。」賈子曰：「貪夫徇財，烈士徇名，夸者死權，眾庶馮生。」「同明相照，同類相求。」「雲從龍，風從虎，聖人作而萬物睹。」伯夷、叔齊雖賢，得夫子而名益彰。顏淵雖篤學，附驥尾而行益顯。巖穴之士，趣舍有時若此，類名堙滅而不稱，悲夫！閭巷之人，欲砥行立名者，非附青雲之士，惡能施于後世哉？","annotation_status":"named_mentions_first_pass","text_layer":"received_chapter","mentions":[{"id":"c-shiji-061-boyi:m009-0001","start":1,"end":3,"surface":"君子","kind":"unresolved","person_id":null,"status":"unresolved","note":"群體、泛稱、引歌中的虞夏或未定指代；不補姓名、成員或肯定王號所指。"},{"id":"c-shiji-061-boyi:m009-0013","start":13,"end":15,"surface":"賈子","kind":"person","person_id":"lyc_370_iba","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-shiji-061-boyi:m009-0018","start":18,"end":20,"surface":"貪夫","kind":"unresolved","person_id":null,"status":"unresolved","note":"群體、泛稱、引歌中的虞夏或未定指代；不補姓名、成員或肯定王號所指。"},{"id":"c-shiji-061-boyi:m009-0023","start":23,"end":25,"surface":"烈士","kind":"unresolved","person_id":null,"status":"unresolved","note":"群體、泛稱、引歌中的虞夏或未定指代；不補姓名、成員或肯定王號所指。"},{"id":"c-shiji-061-boyi:m009-0028","start":28,"end":30,"surface":"夸者","kind":"unresolved","person_id":null,"status":"unresolved","note":"群體、泛稱、引歌中的虞夏或未定指代；不補姓名、成員或肯定王號所指。"},{"id":"c-shiji-061-boyi:m009-0033","start":33,"end":35,"surface":"眾庶","kind":"unresolved","person_id":null,"status":"unresolved","note":"群體、泛稱、引歌中的虞夏或未定指代；不補姓名、成員或肯定王號所指。"},{"id":"c-shiji-061-boyi:m009-0060","start":60,"end":62,"surface":"聖人","kind":"unresolved","person_id":null,"status":"unresolved","note":"群體、泛稱、引歌中的虞夏或未定指代；不補姓名、成員或肯定王號所指。"},{"id":"c-shiji-061-boyi:m009-0069","start":69,"end":71,"surface":"伯夷","kind":"person","person_id":"98v_uic_i4i_A","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-shiji-061-boyi:m009-0072","start":72